  "_README": "HISTORICAL MIRROR of the original 5-test Diagrammatic Reasoning STARTER bank (lib/diagrammaticBank.ts). THIS IS NOT WHAT THE APP SERVES ANY MORE: since v1.1 the Aptitude Test app loads the FULL 30-test library from lib/diagrammaticLibrary.ts - 10 Easy + 10 Medium + 10 Hard tests, 30 questions each (900 questions total), generated deterministically from seeded archetypes and validated through lib/diagrammatic.ts at build time, so the same build always produces the same questions. Neither this file nor lib/diagrammaticBank.ts is imported by the app; they are kept only as the human-readable record of the 5 starter tests the library grew out of. To audit the LIVE question bank, read lib/diagrammaticLibrary.ts (test structure, archetypes, difficulty split) - do not count the tests below and conclude content is missing. Each starter question below is stored as a COMPACT RULE SPEC - lib/diagrammatic.ts expands it into the 8 visible cells (or N-1 sequence steps), the correct option, four near-miss distractors that differ on exactly one property, and the rule explanation. answer_key below is that expansion resolved, so a reviewer can check the key without running the app.",
